                  "lifetimeUnit": "month",
                  "childItemClassifications": [],
                  "metadata": {
                    "mechanics": "This injectable can only be used in the process of agreeing to pay back a debt of a specified amount of currency, generally as part of an agreement when receiving a loan, and a Guide should be present to mark details on the character's sheet. The willing Target (self) is afflicted with Stage 1 Crippling Debt Disease.\n\nCRIPPLING DEBT DISEASE\nStages of Illness: Stage 1 has no symptoms. Every additional stage (max 5) reduces the afflicted character's max Body by 10 points, to a minimum of 1. Every stage after the first comes with lack of sleep and increasing starvation-like symptoms - dark shadows under the eyes, hollow cheeks, shaky/unsteady hands.\nDuration Between Stages: Crippling Debt progresses every month that at least half of the remaining debt is not paid back to the creditor.\nResolution: Full payment of the debt or the permanent death of the creditor cures Crippling Debt at any stage. Death does not cure Crippling Debt. \nImmunity: Contracting this illness and having it cured does not prevent future infection.\nSpecial: This disease cannot be transferred or suppressed by other mechanics.",
